| Variant | Change |
|---|---|
| Row swizzle, G = 8 / 16 / 64 | +2.8% to +6.3% (slower) |
| L2 prefetch 64 / 512 / 2048 rows ahead | +0.1% up to +46% (slower) |
| Reversed row order | −0.2% to +0.2% |
| Two rows per thread (control) | +1.3% to +1.6% |
| One 640-thread CTA per row | −0.1% to −0.2% |

