- 16/16 pass.
- Against r1 on the same GPU: S −0.1%, M −0.9%, L −0.1%, all within noise.
- 32 registers, no spills, 256-bit loads and stores in the SASS.
- Emulator prediction: 0.678 ± 0.011, with a 59% chance of beating the current 0.6755.

